WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.357
Unit three. Fruits and Vegetables!

2
00:00:04.328 --> 00:00:08.045
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.095 --> 00:00:11.605
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.655 --> 00:00:15.712
Today we learn about Fruits and Vegetables. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.512 --> 00:00:19.962
Apple. Say it with me. Apple!

6
00:00:23.446 --> 00:00:26.979
Banana. Say it with me. Banana!

7
00:00:30.482 --> 00:00:34.048
Carrot. Say it with me. Carrot!

8
00:00:37.565 --> 00:00:41.332
Spinach. Say it with me. Spinach!

9
00:00:44.864 --> 00:00:48.614
Vitamin. Say it with me. Vitamin!

10
00:00:52.078 --> 00:00:55.928
Colorful. Say it with me. Colorful!

11
00:00:59.408 --> 00:01:02.892
Fresh. Say it with me. Fresh!

12
00:01:06.411 --> 00:01:09.794
Garden. Say it with me. Garden!

13
00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:23.186
An apple, a banana, and a carrot are all healthy foods. Spinach and other green vegetables have important vitamins. Eating colorful, fresh food from the garden is good for me.

14
00:01:23.236 --> 00:01:24.409
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.805 --> 00:01:31.046
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.096 --> 00:01:32.246
Carrot!

17
00:01:33.076 --> 00:01:38.336
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.386 --> 00:01:39.536
Fresh!

19
00:01:40.441 --> 00:01:49.373
Did you know? Long ago, most carrots were purple or yellow. Orange carrots became popular only about 400 years ago!

20
00:01:49.423 --> 00:01:51.434
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:52.133 --> 00:02:00.199
Think and answer. Name three fruits or vegetables you like to eat.

22
00:02:00.249 --> 00:02:01.399
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.503 --> 00:02:07.456
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:07.506 --> 00:02:10.225
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

